# Ignore EVERYTHING by default, then allow only our own source files.
# This is deliberate: the working folder also holds the company's machine CAD,
# internal specification documents, factory photos, a third-party (Keyence)
# document and the vendor's compiled .mpy modules. None of that is ours to
# publish, so a whitelist is used instead of a blacklist - a new confidential
# file dropped into this folder can never be committed by accident.
*

# --- our own OpenMV vision scripts ---
!.gitignore
!README.md
!chili_stem_detect.py
!chili_bench_test.py
!chili_leftright_gpio.py
!chili_leftright_v2.py
!chili_factory_multi.py
!chili_stopper_factory.py
!main.py
